WEBVTT

00:00:06.612 --> 00:00:07.947
(groans, sighs)

00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:10.157
(groans)

00:00:10.741 --> 00:00:14.662
(sighs weakly)
Ugh.

00:00:14.745 --> 00:00:15.579
(sighs)

00:00:15.663 --> 00:00:17.539
We're still heading
away from home.
我们还是在越飘越远

00:00:21.418 --> 00:00:24.505
Yeah, but we survived,
and we still have each other.
对 但我们活着
而且我们还拥有彼此

00:00:24.588 --> 00:00:25.756
Things could be
worse, right?
这就不算最糟了 对吧

00:00:25.839 --> 00:00:27.716
For once, he's actually right.
这一次 他说的还真没错

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:30.261
We made it through storms
and tidal waves
我们挺过了暴风雨

00:00:30.344 --> 00:00:32.972
and a vicious assortment
of seafood.
还有那个异常凶猛的海鲜

00:00:33.764 --> 00:00:35.808
What more can they
hit us with? Ow!
还有什么能打击到我们

00:00:35.891 --> 00:00:37.810
GRANNY: Trying to make me get
up, when I don't want to get up.
如果我不想起来就别叫我起来

00:00:37.893 --> 00:00:40.229
-If I want to get up, I'd get up.
-Hello?
如果我想起来我自己会起来

00:00:40.312 --> 00:00:41.897
(groans)
What the...?
见鬼

00:00:41.981 --> 00:00:43.732
Dagnabbit, I'm trying to sleep!
吵死人了 我正在睡觉呢

00:00:43.816 --> 00:00:45.526
Granny? You're alive!
奶奶 你还活着

00:00:45.859 --> 00:00:48.237
And can we say how thrilled
we are to see you.
你知道我们看到你有多激动吗

00:00:48.821 --> 00:00:50.698
Hey, fats, you want
to get me out of here?
嘿 肥仔 你来帮我出来吧

00:00:50.781 --> 00:00:52.574
-(sighs)
-Whoo!

00:00:52.658 --> 00:00:54.410
Hey, come on!
嘿 加油

00:00:54.493 --> 00:00:56.870
Pretend I'm a dessert;
that should motivate you.
当我是个甜点 这样就有动力了

00:00:56.954 --> 00:00:58.372
(both straining)

00:00:58.455 --> 00:01:00.249
(Granny & Sid both grunt)

00:01:00.624 --> 00:01:01.500
I can't believe this.
真不敢相信 那种暴风雨你都能睡着

00:01:01.583 --> 00:01:03.168
You slept through that storm?
真不敢相信 那种暴风雨你都能睡着

00:01:03.627 --> 00:01:05.337
Eh, I slept
through the comet
流星撞地球的时候我也一样睡得过去

00:01:05.421 --> 00:01:06.880
that killed the unicorns.
流星撞地球的时候我也一样睡得过去

00:01:07.631 --> 00:01:08.465
(all gasp)

00:01:08.549 --> 00:01:10.426
Thanks for drawing
my bath, Sidney.
谢谢你帮我放好洗澡水

00:01:10.759 --> 00:01:12.720
-Granny, grab my paw!
-No way.
奶奶 快抓住我

00:01:13.095 --> 00:01:15.514
This is my first bath
in decades.
没门 我都几十年没洗澡了

00:01:16.682 --> 00:01:17.975
(burps)

00:01:18.392 --> 00:01:19.643
There's your proof.
一点儿不假

00:01:19.727 --> 00:01:21.729
Quick, somebody do something!
快啊 谁来帮帮忙

00:01:22.479 --> 00:01:23.772
(screams)

00:01:24.732 --> 00:01:25.733
(gasps)

00:01:25.816 --> 00:01:26.650
I got you, Granny.
我来了 奶奶

00:01:26.734 --> 00:01:27.568
Get off of me!
快放开我

00:01:27.651 --> 00:01:28.652
Ow! Oh!
快放开我

00:01:28.736 --> 00:01:30.195
Ow, ow, ow, ow!
奶奶

00:01:30.279 --> 00:01:31.196
Granny.
奶奶

00:01:32.448 --> 00:01:33.657
(grunts)

00:01:33.741 --> 00:01:35.159
(panting)

00:01:35.242 --> 00:01:37.077
What are you peeping toms
all looking at?
你们这群偷窥狂在看啥呢

00:01:37.536 --> 00:01:39.496
Lady can't take
a bath in peace?
洗个澡也不得安宁吗

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:41.206
Eyeballing me
like a rump roast.
瞧你们那些饥渴的眼神

00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:43.917
What's the life expectancy
for a female sloth?
女性树懒的一般寿命是多久

00:01:44.001 --> 00:01:44.835
(Manny groans)

00:01:44.918 --> 00:01:47.212
She'll outlive us all.
You know that, right?
她会比我们都活得久 这你能明白的

00:01:47.629 --> 00:01:49.882
Yeah, the spiteful ones
live the longest.
没错 人至贱则长命百岁

00:01:54.178 --> 00:01:55.429
(gasps)

00:01:55.512 --> 00:01:57.431
(grunting excitedly)

00:01:59.516 --> 00:02:01.435
(grunting)

00:02:05.481 --> 00:02:07.691
(panting)

00:02:07.775 --> 00:02:08.984
(screams)

00:02:09.526 --> 00:02:11.028
(whimpers)

00:02:11.445 --> 00:02:12.571
(sniffing)

00:02:15.866 --> 00:02:17.743
(sniffing)

00:02:21.288 --> 00:02:22.247
Eh...

00:02:22.831 --> 00:02:24.249
(sniffing)

00:02:28.670 --> 00:02:29.797
(gasps)

00:02:30.547 --> 00:02:31.382
(sniffing)

00:02:31.465 --> 00:02:32.883
(gasps)

00:02:33.550 --> 00:02:35.469
(straining)

00:02:39.473 --> 00:02:40.349
(inhales deeply)

00:02:47.022 --> 00:02:48.941
(grunting)

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:01.203
(gasps)

00:03:06.583 --> 00:03:08.377
(straining)

00:03:10.754 --> 00:03:12.214
(sighs)

00:03:16.385 --> 00:03:17.845
(grunts)

00:03:24.351 --> 00:03:25.894
(shrieks)

00:03:25.978 --> 00:03:27.896
(grunting)

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:31.108
(sighs)

00:03:33.652 --> 00:03:34.570
(gasps)

00:03:35.529 --> 00:03:37.865
(grunting):
Hup, two, three, four...

00:03:45.247 --> 00:03:46.498
(screaming)

00:03:49.960 --> 00:03:50.836
(both screaming)

00:03:54.298 --> 00:03:56.133
(panting)

00:03:56.633 --> 00:03:58.093
(ship bell clanging)

00:03:58.177 --> 00:03:59.845
(ship creaking)

00:04:02.598 --> 00:04:05.184
MANNY: How big is this ocean?!
这个海也太大了吧

00:04:06.602 --> 00:04:09.396
Water, water, everywhere.
水啊 水啊 到处都是

00:04:10.731 --> 00:04:13.317
Nor any drop to drink.
可是一滴也不能喝

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:14.985
Well, except maybe that drop.
说不定这一滴可以

00:04:18.906 --> 00:04:20.157
Mmm, that's a little...
嗯 好像有一点

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:22.159
(gasps):
salty.
太咸了

00:04:22.242 --> 00:04:23.452
GRANNY: Precious!
宝宝

00:04:23.869 --> 00:04:28.040
-Mommy's calling you! Precious!
-(sighs)
妈妈在叫你呢

00:04:28.123 --> 00:04:29.500
Come here, sweetie.
快过来 小宝贝

00:04:29.583 --> 00:04:31.627
Hey, lady, have
you seen Precious?
你看到宝宝了吗

00:04:31.710 --> 00:04:34.213
If you mean the imaginary,
or perhaps deceased, pet
如果你是指你一直在找的那个

00:04:34.296 --> 00:04:37.174
that you keep searching for,
no, I haven't.
不 我没看见

00:04:37.257 --> 00:04:38.091
(bird squawks)

00:04:38.175 --> 00:04:39.301
Guys, look!
大伙儿 快看

00:04:39.384 --> 00:04:40.594
Where there's birds,
有鸟儿的地方 就有陆地 对吧

00:04:40.677 --> 00:04:41.929
there's land, right?
有鸟儿的地方 就有陆地 对吧

00:04:42.012 --> 00:04:43.430
Hey, buddy, come here!
嘿 伙计 到这儿来

00:04:43.514 --> 00:04:44.932
(squawking)

00:04:45.599 --> 00:04:47.059
No, wait, wait!
Come back!
等等 快回来

00:04:49.019 --> 00:04:50.145
Come back!
快回来啊

00:05:01.114 --> 00:05:01.949
(panting)

00:05:02.032 --> 00:05:04.409
It's a huge bounty,
mon capitaine.
这是笔大买卖 我的船长

00:05:04.493 --> 00:05:05.911
Four passengers.
一共四个人

00:05:05.994 --> 00:05:08.163
Ripe for the taking.
随时可以下手

00:05:08.247 --> 00:05:11.792
One very smelly
and one very plump.
一个臭气熏天 一个肥头大耳

00:05:11.875 --> 00:05:13.293
In my ocean?
在我的海域

00:05:14.086 --> 00:05:16.255
What a terrible
turn of events.
真是命运无情的安排

00:05:17.005 --> 00:05:20.217
I love a terrible
turn of events.
我最爱命运无情的安排了

00:05:20.717 --> 00:05:24.304
(laughing deeply)

00:05:28.767 --> 00:05:29.643
(groans)

00:05:30.143 --> 00:05:31.478
(voices in distance)

00:05:31.562 --> 00:05:34.773
Am I hallucinating, or is that
ice coming straight towards us?
是我的幻觉还是那冰山在向我们逼近

00:05:34.856 --> 00:05:36.233
Yeah, yeah, it's coming.
没错 是它来了

00:05:36.316 --> 00:05:37.818
It sounds like
there's animals on it!
听起来上面还有其他动物

00:05:37.901 --> 00:05:41.405
Yippee! We're being rescued.
We're being rescued.
我们得救了 我们得救了

00:05:41.488 --> 00:05:42.864
I hear laughter.
我听见笑声了

00:05:42.948 --> 00:05:45.158
Oh! Must be a party cruise.
肯定是个游艇派对

00:05:45.242 --> 00:05:46.201
(gasps)

